%N A399486 Number of strict triangular plane partitions of n.
%F A399486 G.f.: Sum_{i>=0} (i*(i+1)/2)! * q^(i*(1+i)*(2+i+i^2)/8)/( Product_{j=1..i-1} ((2*j+1)^(i-j)) * Product_{k=1..i*(i+1)/2} (1 - q^k) ).
